"在「独立处理」中载入 TIFF 或 JPEG，按需勾选灰尘、划痕、毛发／纤维。点「直接开始除尘」会跳过观片台，开始检测已载入的照片。" = "Load TIFF or JPEG photos in Standalone mode and select dust, scratches, or hair and fibers as needed. Click Start Dust Removal to skip the light table and start scanning the imported photos.";
"已载入的照片直接显示在来源页。可以继续添加照片或文件夹，也可以在列表中逐张移除。" = "Imported photos appear on the source page. Add more photos or folders, or remove individual photos from the list.";
"TIFF 内嵌缩略图明确标记为低分辨率预览时，按全尺寸主图处理。多页 TIFF 请先导出为单帧。" = "For TIFFs with embedded thumbnails tagged as reduced-resolution images, PURE Neg processes the full-resolution image. Export a single frame from a multipage TIFF before importing it.";
"在审核页切换「原图」「修复后」和「分割对比」。滚动缩放，按住空格拖动可平移。打开修复蒙版可查看将被修复的像素，颜色和不透明度可调。" = "Switch between Original, Repaired, and Split View in the review window. Scroll to zoom, and hold Space while dragging to pan. Show the repair mask to see which pixels will be repaired. You can adjust its color and opacity.";
"在左侧「检测灵敏度」下，调整已启用的灰尘、划痕和毛发／纤维滑块。点「重新检测」更新当前照片，运行期间仍显示上一版预览。手动笔画会保留，无法匹配的旧排除点位会提示复核。" = "Under Detection Sensitivity in the left sidebar, adjust the sliders for the enabled detection types. Click Rescan to update the current photo. The previous preview stays visible while rescanning. Manual strokes carry over, and PURE Neg flags any previous exclusions it cannot match.";
"启用毛发／纤维检测后，可调整「纤维弯曲度」和「纤维软度」再重新检测。较高的弯曲度有助于找出短而弯的纤维，较高的软度会接纳更宽、更模糊的痕迹。调高后请检查发丝、褶皱和背景轮廓有没有被误修。" = "With hair and fiber detection enabled, adjust Fiber Curvature and Fiber Softness, then rescan. Higher curvature helps find shorter, more curved fibers, while higher softness accepts wider and blurrier marks. Check hair, folds, and background edges for unwanted repairs after raising either setting.";
"「斑块（试验）」默认关闭，可尝试识别较宽的亮色碎屑和斑块。扫描包含片边时，在审核页开启「保留片边和齿孔」，预览会自动更新，保护检测到的片边、齿孔和片号。" = "Blotches (Beta) is off by default and can detect wider bright debris and blotches. For scans that include film borders, turn on Preserve film borders and sprocket holes in the review window. The preview updates automatically to protect detected borders, sprocket holes, and frame numbers.";
"在检查模式把鼠标移到蒙版上的自动点位可查看检测类别。点击点位后，可在鼠标旁选择「撤销识别」，也可在左侧点位列表取消勾选。按 B 用画笔补修漏点，按 E 用橡皮擦恢复误修，按 V 返回检查。" = "In Inspect mode, hover over an automatic repair in the mask to see its category. Click the spot, then choose Undo Detection next to it or clear its checkbox in the spot list. Press B to brush in a missed spot, E to erase an unwanted repair, or V to inspect.";
"按 【 或 】 缩小或增大画笔半径。按 ⌘Z 撤销修整，按 ⇧⌘Z 重做。" = "Press [ or ] to change the brush radius. Press ⌘Z to undo an edit and ⇧⌘Z to redo it.";
"在导出窗口选择 TIFF、JPEG 或 PNG，可设置色彩空间、位深，以及相应的 TIFF 压缩或 JPEG 质量。色彩空间和位深可选择「保持原样」，JPEG 始终为 8 位。修复蒙版可按需附带。" = "Choose TIFF, JPEG, or PNG in the export window. Set the color space, bit depth, and TIFF compression or JPEG quality where applicable. Choose Same as Source for color space and bit depth. JPEG always uses 8-bit color. You can also include the repair mask.";
"点「在观片器中查看」，用右下角电源点亮修复后的照片。支持 HDR 的屏幕会按可用亮度呈现观片效果。顶部按钮可左右旋转 90°、水平或垂直翻转，方向只用于预览。点击右下角的放大镜或直接把它拖到照片上，双击放大镜或拖回右下角可归位。" = "Click View on Light Table, then use the power button at the lower right to light the repaired photo. On HDR displays, the light table uses the available display brightness. The top controls rotate the preview 90° left or right or flip it horizontally or vertically. Click the loupe in the lower-right corner or drag it onto the photo. Double-click it or drag it back to the corner to put it away.";
"拖动放大镜的蓝点可调整镜面大小，绿点可调整放大倍率。也可在镜内滚动或捏合缩放。放大镜获得焦点时，按 + 或 − 调整倍率，按住 Option 再按可调整镜面大小。" = "Drag the blue handle to resize the loupe and the green handle to change its magnification. You can also scroll or pinch inside the lens to zoom. With the loupe focused, use + or − to zoom, or hold Option while pressing either key to resize.";
"载入多张 TIFF 或 JPEG 后，点「打开观片台」。在下方点底片将它移入候选区，再点一次可放回底片袋。候选区为空时，点「下一步」会纳入全部照片。" = "Load multiple TIFFs or JPEGs, then click Open Light Table. Click a frame below to add it to your picks. Click it again to return it to the sleeve. If there are no picks, Next includes all photos.";
"观片台和审核页默认铺满所在屏幕的可用区域。审核时切换照片会保留窗口位置与尺寸。点「返回灯板」可以重新选片。" = "The light table and review window fill the available area on their display by default. Switching photos keeps the review window's size and position. Click Back to Light Table to change your picks.";
"观片台右下角的电源按钮可点亮灯板。支持 HDR 时，灯板、底片和底片袋的透光区域会提亮，边框与接缝以标准动态范围绘制。" = "Use the power button at the lower right to light the table. On HDR displays, the table, film, and translucent parts of the sleeves brighten. The borders and seams stay in standard dynamic range.";
"开灯后可在底部调整曝光、亮部、暗部和伽马。曝光以 0 EV 为基准，范围是 −8 至 +8 EV。亮部可调到屏幕当前可用的 HDR 上限，伽马调整中间调。点「确认」会保存这组数值和屏幕的 HDR 余量。" = "With the lamp on, adjust Exposure, Highlights, Shadows, and Gamma at the bottom. Exposure is centered at 0 EV and runs from −8 to +8 EV. Highlights can reach your display’s current HDR limit. Gamma adjusts midtones. Confirm saves these settings and display headroom.";
"审核页右侧只列出本批选中的照片，并保留原始帧号。检测和导出进度显示在对应文件名下方。各帧独立保留画笔修整和排除点位。" = "The right sidebar lists the photos in this batch with their original frame numbers. Scan and export progress appear under each file name. Brush edits and excluded spots are kept separately for each frame.";
"检查修复结果后，在左下角的「导出」区选择「导出当前」或「导出所选」。在右侧可逐张勾选预览就绪的照片，也可用「全选」或「全不选」操作。" = "After checking the repairs, choose Export Current or Export Selected at the bottom left. In the right sidebar, check ready photos individually or use Select All or Deselect All.";
"照片直接保存到所选目录，文件名以「-PN」标记，重名时自动加序号。导出后仍可在当前批次用画笔补修漏点或用橡皮擦恢复误修，再导出新版本。" = "Photos are saved to the selected folder with “-PN” in the filename. Duplicate names get a number. After exporting, you can still use the brush or eraser in the current batch and export another version.";
"遇到漏检或误修时，在审核页用画笔补修漏点，用「撤销识别」或橡皮擦恢复误修的细节。记录这些修整，有助于改进识别模型。" = "In the review window, brush over missed defects and use Undo Detection or the eraser to restore details repaired by mistake. These corrections help improve the detection model.";
"打开「PURE Neg → 设置 → 导出」，开启「导出训练数据包」，再在导出窗口勾选「导出训练数据包」。照片若仍有未修整处，请取消勾选「这张已修干净（可用于训练）」。" = "Turn on Export Training Packs in PURE Neg → Settings → Export, then check Include a training pack in the export window. If repairs are still incomplete, clear Repairs are complete (suitable for training).";
"修复照片旁会生成一个以「-training」结尾的文件夹，包含未修复的扫描图、自动检测与手动修整的各层蒙版、修复点和检测设置。请保留整个文件夹。" = "A folder ending in “-training” appears beside the repaired photo. It contains the unrepaired scan, mask layers for automatic detection and manual edits, repair regions, and detection settings. Keep the entire folder.";
"在复现问题的同一次运行中，打开「PURE Neg → 设置 → 维护」，点击「保存诊断报告…」。将未经修改的原片、整个训练数据包和诊断报告一起压缩成 ZIP，邮件发送至 easonzhang@studiopure.cn，并简单注明漏检或误修的位置。" = "In the same session in which you reproduced the issue, open PURE Neg → Settings → Maintenance and click Save Diagnostic Report. ZIP the unmodified original scan, the entire training pack, and the diagnostic report. Email the ZIP to easonzhang@studiopure.cn and briefly note where detection missed a defect or repaired a detail.";
"训练数据包和诊断报告都保存在本机，由你决定是否发送。请只提供你有权分享的照片。" = "Training packs and diagnostic reports are saved locally for you to share at your discretion. Send only photos you have permission to share.";
"批量审核时优先检测当前照片。检测中可直接点另一张切换，正在检测的照片会让出引擎。" = "Batch review scans the current photo first. Click another photo during detection to switch to it and let it take over the engine.";
"默认停止操作 4 秒后，后台逐张检测本批剩余照片。恢复滚动、缩放或拖动等操作时，后台检测会暂停并保留进度，重新闲置后继续。右侧列表会标出当前的后台状态。" = "By default, after four seconds of inactivity, detection starts on the remaining photos one at a time. Scrolling, zooming, or dragging pauses detection at its current progress. It resumes when idle, and the right sidebar shows its status.";
"生成修整预览、导出或检测另一张照片需要使用引擎时，后台任务先让出引擎。为控制内存占用，闲置后可能从头检测那张被中断的照片。" = "When a repair preview, export, or another scan needs the engine, the background task yields. To limit memory use, the interrupted photo may start scanning again from the beginning when idle.";
"可在「PURE Neg → 设置 → 性能」关闭「闲置时自动检测」。右侧「停止检测」会停止当前批次的自动检测，点「检测本批」可重新开始。" = "Turn off Detect Automatically When Idle in PURE Neg → Settings → Performance. Stop Scan pauses automatic scanning for this batch. Use Scan Batch to start it again.";
"选择「从 PhotoCraft 载入」并启动或连接专用会话，在该会话中打开照片。通过 PURE Neg 审核后可将修复图层和蒙版导回 PhotoCraft。" = "Choose From PhotoCraft and launch or connect to a dedicated session. Open the photo in that session. After reviewing in PURE Neg, you can send the repair layer and mask back to PhotoCraft.";
"在 Photoshop 中打开文档，然后选择「从 Photoshop 载入」并点「载入并预览」。首次使用时按 macOS 提示允许通信。PURE Neg 载入当前文档的可见合成，可审核并另存为新文件。" = "Open a document in Photoshop, then choose From Photoshop and click Import & Preview. On first use, allow communication when macOS prompts you. PURE Neg imports the visible composite for review and export to a new file.";
"在「PURE Neg → 设置」可以更改语言、默认导出格式、目录和蒙版选项，也可以清理旧审核缓存或保存本次运行的诊断报告。自动导出目录为 ~/Pictures/PURENeg，语言切换在重启后生效。" = "Use PURE Neg → Settings to change the language, export format, default location, and mask option. You can also clear old review caches or save a diagnostic report for this session. The automatic export location is ~/Pictures/PURENeg. Reopen the app to apply a language change.";
"在「性能」中可为支持的图像启用 Metal 预览。「处理模式」选「高性能」可并行解压支持的 TIFF。内存充足时，模型推理和基础检测也可同时进行。" = "Performance settings include Metal previews for supported images. Choose High Performance under Processing Mode to decompress supported TIFFs in parallel. With enough memory, model inference and base detection can also run concurrently.";
"内存为 16 GB 或更少的 Mac 默认开启「节省内存」。它会缩小预览缓存，对超过 6400 万像素的照片用较小的工作图检测灰尘和纤维。细小痕迹的检测结果可能变化，修复和导出使用原始分辨率。" = "Conserve Memory is on by default on Macs with 16 GB of memory or less. It shrinks the preview cache and uses a smaller working image to detect dust and fibers on scans over 64 megapixels. Fine-detail detection can vary. Repair and export use the original resolution.";
"自动检测和修补基于 Magnus Holmes 的 film-dust（MIT，基准提交 fcf68d6）。引擎使用 JavaScript，在可用时通过 Node-API 调用 C++ 内核加速滤波、检测和推理。PURE Neg 在原始像素上补充划痕检测与纤维追踪。" = "Automatic detection and repair build on Magnus Holmes’s film-dust (MIT, base commit fcf68d6). The JavaScript engine uses Node-API to run C++ kernels for filtering, detection, and inference when available. PURE Neg adds full-resolution scratch detection and fiber tracking.";
"纤维模型在 FibreNet v3 基础上，用人工审核的样本和合成瑕疵续训，通过 Core ML 在本机生成纤维概率图。引擎结合概率、线宽、形状和周边画面判断是否修复，并尝试沿纤维接回较淡的尾端。" = "The fiber model was fine-tuned from FibreNet v3 on manually reviewed samples and synthetic defects. It uses Core ML to generate a fiber probability map on-device. The engine uses probability, width, shape, and surrounding image structure to decide what to repair and tries to trace fainter fiber ends.";
"上游骨架细化使用 scikit-image 的查表方法。按上游许可说明，场景判断模型源自 torchvision 的 MobileNetV3-small ImageNet 权重。两项引用均采用 BSD 3-Clause 许可。" = "The upstream skeleton thinning uses a lookup-table method from scikit-image. According to the upstream notices, the scene model derives from torchvision MobileNetV3-small ImageNet weights. Both are licensed under BSD 3-Clause.";
"应用内附 Node.js，图像处理在本机运行。界面使用 AppKit 与 SwiftUI，ImageIO 用于 JPEG 导入、JPEG 和 PNG 导出及预览，支持的预览可用 Core Image 与 Metal 加速。观片台的 HDR 光源使用 Core Animation 的扩展动态范围。" = "The app bundles Node.js and processes images locally. The interface uses AppKit and SwiftUI. ImageIO handles JPEG import, JPEG and PNG export, and previews. Core Image and Metal can accelerate supported previews. The HDR light table uses Core Animation’s extended dynamic range.";
"闲置时启动后台任务的交互参考 Final Cut Pro 的后台渲染。PURE Neg 自行调度除尘任务，并通过 macOS 进程组一起暂停或恢复检测与解码进程。" = "Idle detection takes its cue from background rendering in Final Cut Pro. PURE Neg schedules its own dust removal jobs and uses macOS process groups to pause and resume detection and decoding together.";
"查看 film-dust 基准提交" = "View the film-dust base commit";
